{"final":{"summary":"The change query for 12:00-14:15Z (all services, kinds deploy/config/migration/flag) returned only two deploys, order-router at 13:24Z and auth-kyc at 13:26Z, both labelled minor copy changes. No deploy, config, migration or flag change was recorded for llm-gateway, orchestrator, redis-cache, rabbitmq or portfolio-svc in that window, which weakens the idea of a config-driven trigger on those services. I could not check environment/secret, scaling, quota/rate-limit or scheduled-job changes, or inbound/llm-gateway request rates, because my tools do not cover them. The past-incident search for llm-gateway 429/quota/traffic spikes returned nothing.",
