"gaps":["get_changes only supports deploy, config, migration and flag kinds, so environment/secret updates, scaling changes, quota/rate-limit changes and scheduled jobs for llm-gateway, orchestrator, redis-cache, rabbitmq and portfolio-svc were not checked. Out-of-band changes of those types are therefore not excluded.","No tool returns request rates, so wa-webhook inbound rps and llm-gateway rps before 13:55Z were not checked. A traffic increase as the 429 trigger is neither confirmed nor ruled out.","The search for llm-gateway 429/quota/traffic spikes returned no results, so no past incident supports or refutes that cause.","No get_dependencies calls were made in this task, so the blast radius of order-router and auth-kyc was not verified."]
